+
+/// Cindy (`com.xd.cindy` global, `com.xd.cindycn` cn): two GitHub rules on
+/// `makecindy/cindy` and a changelog recipe per bundle id over the same release
+/// bodies. What is pinned: the stable tags and no beta, each region and
+/// architecture gets its own dmg and never the other region's, and the notes come
+/// out as the changes under their headings. The bodies also carry a build
+/// provenance block that the generic release-notes parser reads as the changes.
+///
+/// See `docs/app-audits/com-xd-cindy.md` for the measurements.
