+  "body": "Desktop release 0.1.106\n\n## 更新说明\n### 🧩 插件变多后界面不再卡顿\n修复了安装插件越多、界面越卡的问题：插件列表刷新不再随已装插件数量急剧变慢，装十几个插件时也从要等上几秒变成几乎瞬间完成。\n\n\n## PRs\n[#5296](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5296) [#5533](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5533) [#5853](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5853) [#5871](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5871) [#5881](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5881) [#5884](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5884) [#5885](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5885) [#5887](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5887) [#5888](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5888) [#5893](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5893) [#5894](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5894) [#5895](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5895) [#5896](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5896) [#5897](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5897) [#5898](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5898) [#5907](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5907) [#5908](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5908) [#5909](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5909) [#5910](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5910) [#5911](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5911) [#5912](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5912) [#5913](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5913) [#5914](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/5914)\n\n---\n- commit: `0531f6a5c4b56d9ac19cc499e67956807acc38e1`\n- source tag: `beta2026-10-13_21-12-21`\n- regions: cn global\n- iOS(cn):整包 0.1.12(2026101001) · 热更 d951ad4e\n- Android(cn):整包 0.1.23(36) · 热更 aa508b02\n- iOS(global):整包 0.1.12(2026101001) · 热更 bafcea12\n- Android(global):整包 0.1.23(29) · 热更 a0084f37\n"
+ },
+ {
